  "c05_entry_capability.execution_ready_claimed_for_unwired.trap": {
    "schema": "c05_capabilities",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "target_contract",
    "note": "形状**合法但语义错误**的诱饵样例（chat 被宣称 execution_ready）。纯 schema 无法拒绝它——这正是 §3.3 需要源码投影测试的原因：`test_only_search_is_execution_ready` 要求 execution_ready 必须等于 builder 输出，本样例即该守卫的证伪输入。expect=valid 只表示**形状**合法。",
    "value": {
      "contract": "c05-v1",
      "enabled": true,
      "preview_supported": false,
      "entries": {
        "search": {
          "scope_modes": ["all", "selected", "single"],
          "execution_modes": ["auto"],
          "context_levels": ["focused"],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": true,
          "unavailable_reason": null
        },
        "chat": {
          "scope_modes": ["all", "selected", "single"],
          "execution_modes": ["auto"],
          "context_levels": ["focused"],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": true,
          "unavailable_reason": null
        },
        "coverage": {
          "scope_modes": ["all"],
          "execution_modes": [],
          "context_levels": [],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": false,
          "unavailable_reason": "c05_entry_not_wired"
        },
        "compare": {
          "scope_modes": ["all"],
          "execution_modes": [],
          "context_levels": [],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": false,
          "unavailable_reason": "c05_entry_not_wired"
        },
        "ai_insight": {
          "scope_modes": ["all"],
          "execution_modes": [],
          "context_levels": [],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": false,
          "unavailable_reason": "c05_entry_not_wired"
        },
        "transformation": {
          "scope_modes": ["all"],
          "execution_modes": [],
          "context_levels": [],
          "preview_supported": false,
          "execution_ready": false,
          "unavailable_reason": "c05_entry_not_wired"
        }
      }
    },
    "note": "本样例在**形状**上合法但语义错误——由 §6 的源码投影测试（execution_ready 必须等于 builder 输出）拒绝，不由纯 schema 拒绝。"
  },
  "c05_error.scope_selected_empty.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "scope_selected_empty",
      "message": "mode=selected has no resolvable source; select at least one source or provide a non-empty note",
      "recovery_action": "reselect_sources",
      "acceptance": "not_accepted"
    },
    "note": "HTTP 422 + 对象 detail；接受写入之前拒绝 ⇒ not_accepted。"
  },
  "c05_error.entry_not_ready.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "c05_entry_not_ready",
      "entry": "chat",
      "message": "the C-05 scope contract is not wired for this entry yet; keep the c05-v1 intent and do not resend as v1",
      "retryable": false,
      "recovery_action": "show_unavailable",
      "acceptance": "not_accepted"
    },
    "note": "HTTP 503；门禁在接受之前 ⇒ not_accepted；retryable=false 表示同部署重试不会变绿。"
  },
  "c05_error.acceptance_outcome_unknown.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "acceptance_outcome_unknown",
      "message": "the acceptance outcome could not be verified",
      "generation_id": "gen_synth_0001",
      "retry_with_original_idempotency_key": true,
      "recovery_action": "reconcile_then_retry",
      "acceptance": "unknown"
    },
    "note": "HTTP 409：结果**不明**——保留原材料与原键查证，不写成失败、不新建替代执行。`retry_with_original_idempotency_key` 只授权**查证**。"
  },
  "c05_error.terminal_model_unknown.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "outcome_unknown",
      "message": "generation outcome is unknown; do not retry with the same idempotency key",
      "generation_id": "gen_synth_0002",
      "state": "outcome_unknown",
      "recovery_action": "stop_and_confirm",
      "acceptance": "accepted"
    },
    "note": "外部模型调用**可能已发送**：不自动重发、不因换 key 重新执行；沿既有显式人工恢复机制。与上一条的 recovery_action 必须不同。"
  },
  "c05_error.unconfirmed_rollback.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "acceptance_budget_exhausted",
      "message": "the acceptance budget was exhausted before arming timeouts",
      "retryable": true,
      "recovery_action": "reconcile_then_retry",
      "acceptance": "unknown"
    },
    "note": "同一稳定码在**回滚未确认**（zero_accept_writes=false）时出现：本次尝试**可能已写入**，因此不得报 not_accepted。§5 表：以具体分支 rollback/commit_attempted 为准。"
  },
  "c05_error.unrecognised_code.valid": {
    "schema": "c05_error_detail",
    "expect": "valid",
    "origin": "current_api",
    "value": {
      "code": "quota_unavailable",
      "message": "quota ledger is not configured",
      "retryable": false,
      "recovery_action": "stop_and_confirm",
      "acceptance": "unknown",
      "action_recognised": false
    },
    "note": "既有层错误不落入 #615 的自动重试 blanket：acceptance=unknown（状态码本身不能证明零接受），action_recognised=false 提示按既有语义处理。"
  },
